      {
        "operation": "create_text",
        "payload": {
          "filename": "Kevin Vehicle Transport Mission Pack - SOP.md",
          "content": "# Kevin Vehicle Transport Mission Pack\n\nUse this pack to turn a transport request into a verified mission rather than a string of assumptions.\n\n## Required sequence\n1. Capture pickup, destination, vehicle identity and required delivery time.\n2. Resolve driver and truck/trailer suitability.\n3. Confirm keys, paperwork, run/drive condition and special handling before departure.\n4. Record pickup condition and evidence.\n5. Track delays and changes explicitly.\n6. Record delivery condition and completion evidence.\n\n## Protective behavior\nKevin should flag VIN/vehicle mismatches, missing keys or documents, impossible timing, unknown pickup/delivery location, unverified trailer suitability, unresolved warning conditions and conflicting instructions. Kevin may prepare calls/messages or purchase needs but may not send, purchase or commit on Matt's behalf without the required authority.\n"
